---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Sign Language Translator"
  description="Terms of service for SignLanguage-Translator.com."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-slate-500">Last updated: October 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-6 space-y-6 text-slate-700">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Educational purpose only</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          SignLanguage-Translator.com is a free ASL vocabulary learning aid. It is
          not a professional interpreting service, and nothing on this site should
          be relied upon for medical, legal, emergency, or other high-stakes
          communication. Always use a qualified, certified interpreter for
          important matters.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Accuracy</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Sign descriptions are text-based guides researched from established ASL
          references and rewritten in original words. While we work to keep them
          correct, ASL has regional variation and we cannot guarantee every
          description matches every signer's usage. If you spot an error, please
          tell us via the <a class="font-semibold text-indigo-700 underline" href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Acceptable use</h2>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
          <li>Use the site for personal learning and education.</li>
          <li>Don't scrape, copy, or republish large portions of the dictionary content.</li>
          <li>Don't attempt to disrupt the site or misrepresent it as a certified interpreting service.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Content ownership</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Site design, text, and dictionary wording are the property of FK Digital
          Media. You may quote brief excerpts with attribution; republication of
          substantial content requires permission.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">No warranty</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The site is provided "as is", without warranties of any kind. To the
          extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any reliance placed on
          the content.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Questions about these terms:{" "}
          <a class="font-semibold text-indigo-700 underline" href="mailto:fkdigitalmedia@gmail.com">
            fkdigitalmedia@gmail.com
          </a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
